1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,065
Peechhe dekho, meva gira! Aur ye dekho, abhi bhi khod rahi hai.

2
00:00:04,245 --> 00:00:07,478
Bhookhi toh hai. Phir ise wahaan aisa kya mil gaya?

3
00:00:07,958 --> 00:00:11,174
Subah ki baat hai. Mitti par ek chhota sa nishaan tha.

4
00:00:11,304 --> 00:00:13,991
Hawa chali toh nishaan ki ek tahni sarak gayi.

5
00:00:14,181 --> 00:00:17,669
Par ise laga, Arey, apne meve toh maine yahin dabaaye the!

6
00:00:17,889 --> 00:00:20,526
Panja maara. Nikla kya? Ek keeda.

7
00:00:20,776 --> 00:00:23,685
Itne mein, peechhe ki daal se ek aur meva tapka.

8
00:00:23,825 --> 00:00:27,587
Is baar aawaaz sunkar mudi. Bas do chhalaang lagaani thin.

9
00:00:27,867 --> 00:00:31,497
Phir apne panje dekhe. Itna khod liya, ab chali jaaun?

10
00:00:31,647 --> 00:00:35,153
Panjon se mitti jhad rahi thi. Socha, bas thoda sa aur.

11
00:00:35,303 --> 00:00:38,014
Ek parat aur hati. Aur neeche? Patthar.

12
00:00:38,254 --> 00:00:41,598
Patthar bhi hataaya. Ab chhodna aur mushkil lag raha tha.

13
00:00:41,798 --> 00:00:45,561
Shaam ho gayi. Udhar ek meve ke bagal mein teen aur gir chuke the.

14
00:00:45,761 --> 00:00:48,804
Ek chidiya aayi, meva uthaaya aur furr se ud gayi.

15
00:00:48,954 --> 00:00:52,580
Uski parchhaai gaddhe par padi toh gilhari ne sir uthaaya.

16
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:55,602
Meve use bhi dikhe. Phir bhi baithi rahi, wahin.

17
00:00:55,872 --> 00:00:56,857
Pata hai kyon?

18
00:00:57,317 --> 00:01:03,201
Ab use bhookh se zyaada is baat ki chubhan thi. Kahin subah se galat jagah toh nahin khod rahi thi?

19
00:01:03,591 --> 00:01:07,980
Achha, tumhaare saath kabhi cinema mein aisa hua hai? Film shuru hui.

20
00:01:08,180 --> 00:01:11,124
Bees minute beete, aur man kiya ki yaar, ghar chalen.

21
00:01:11,324 --> 00:01:15,665
Darwaaza khula hai. Tabhi ticket par nazar gayi. Teen sau rupaye diye hain!

22
00:01:15,835 --> 00:01:18,862
Par tum utho ya baithe raho, woh paise toh jaa chuke.

23
00:01:19,042 --> 00:01:22,136
Ab jo jaa sakta hai, woh tumhaara agla ghanta hai.

24
00:01:22,436 --> 00:01:24,222
Yahi hai sunk cost ka jaal.

25
00:01:24,402 --> 00:01:28,160
Socho, ticket muft mila hota, toh abhi bhi baithe rehte?

26
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:33,063
Aur gilhari? Usne panje jhaade, peechhe mudi. Khaana toh wahin tha.
